<section class="cw-container cw-workspace" id="workspace" aria-labelledby="cw-workspace-title">
  <div class="cw-section-heading"><p class="cw-eyebrow">One place to work it out</p><h2 id="cw-workspace-title">Start small.<br />Keep going.</h2><p>Ordinary projects and guided learning share the same workspace. Move between exploring an idea and understanding how it works.</p></div>
